I've found one small bug (?) in the endgame "Riders".  Normally when you kill
Death, Famine, or Pestilence they *always* regenerate.  I found one way that
will let you (or another monster) kill them and keep them dead.





















After they're dead, if their corpse tries to regenerate and there is 
another live monster standing on top of their corpse, they never come
back.  Basically, they try to regenerate, fail, and their corpse will
then stay dead until it rots away.
